            portrait: "portraits/haldric-surprised.webp",
            text: _("We needed him to get out of here. We’re trapped!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "lose",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_48",
        on: "victory",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Prince Haldric",
            text: _("We’ve escaped from the orcs before the winter ice could trap us! Now, on to Southbay."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Burin the Lost",
            portrait: "portraits/burin-annoyed.webp",
            text: _("I know I mentioned I can’t float."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lady Jessene",
            text: _("Might I suggest a bit of a detour?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Prince Haldric",
            text: _("Why?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lady Jessene",
            text: _("You have the Ruby of Fire, but you have no idea what it does, correct? You know that lich you have petrified just outside of Southbay—"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Prince Haldric",
            text: _("Yes, Lich Point! Where we first used our magi in battle, and turned the tide of war against your people."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lady Jessene",
            text: _("Erm, yes... He was Caror, the arch rival of our dearly departed Lich-Lord Lenvan. He coveted the ruby, and was studying it. The only copy of his study, the Book of Fire and Darkness, was petrified along with him."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Prince Haldric",
            text: _("If we make landfall outside of Southbay, we’ll be trapped. Of that I am sure!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Commander Aethyr",
            text: _("My family was from Southbay. My father was a soldier there. The city’s sewer entrance is near that fossil of a lich."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Prince Haldric",
            text: _("Wow, this is beginning to sound dangerously like a plan. Commander Aethyr, will you join us?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Commander Aethyr",
            text: _("No. These monsters killed my family. My wife, my daughters. There is nothing left for me. I’ll stay. By the time the orcs wrestle Clearwater Port away from me there’ll be nothing but rubble left!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Commander Aethyr",
            text: _("The peasant farmers seem to like you. Who knows, maybe they’ll be of some help."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Prince Haldric",
            text: _("Resources are scarce, we need all of the help we can get. Be brave and fight hard, my friend!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:config_recruit",
            side: 1,
            mode: "allow",
            types: "Peasant",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_49",
        on: "enemies_defeated",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
        ],
      },
    ],
  },
